{"product_id":"good-gut-healing-the-no-nonsense-guide-to-bowel-digestive-disorders","title":"Good Gut Healing: The No-Nonsense Guide to Bowel \u0026 Digestive Disorders","description":"\u003cp\u003eAn examination of the many commonbut rarely addressedailments that can affect the digestive system and bowel, with suggestions of natural ways to tackle the symptoms and ease discomfort. The manual includes: 20 top tips for a healthy gut; advice on which foods to eat and which to avoid; action plans for dealing with every condition from acid reflux, bloating and candida to irritable bowel, leaky gut and ulcers; information on fiber, allergies and sensitivities, detoxification and stress; and boxes containing hints and tips.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kathryn Marsden\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780749924485\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45879000367257,"sku":"13RC9780749924485","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6911b947e022f_Good_Gut_Healing_The_No-Nonsense_Guide_to_Bowel___Digestive_Disorders__1.jpg?v=1762792736","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/good-gut-healing-the-no-nonsense-guide-to-bowel-digestive-disorders","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}